   - `Interval.fromISO("foo/bar")` throws InvalidIntervalError
   Use `npx babel-node` with a script that does `require("/luxon/src/luxon")` or similar; figure out the right import path by inspecting /luxon/src/luxon.js and /luxon/package.json.
3. Run the full test suite `cd /luxon && npx jest 2>&1 | tail -30` and report the counts. Note: `test/datetime/toFormat.test.js` has 2 pre-existing failures (French ICU formatting) that are unrelated — confirm they are the same as before your change.

